      "text": "Accident-only, hospital indemnity, specified disease, dental-only, vision-only, disability income and long-term care policies are excepted benefits and are not subject to the ACA coverage rules in this lesson. That is why those policies may still underwrite, exclude pre-existing conditions and cap benefits.",
